WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.650
<i>It is your story,
and it is someone's story.</i>

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.610
<i>It is a story of a certain journey.</i>

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.600
It's a success! We did it!

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:33.480
D-Director!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.900
Director, it's dangerous!
Please retreat!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.790
Second defensive bounded field
has been breached!

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.590
Why aren't they evacuating?

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:30.000
Fate/Grand Order
Absolute Demonic Front: Babylonia

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.270
I must hurry.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.570
<i>That's right. I had to hurry.</i>

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:02.740
<i>Because I didn't even have
a second to waste.</i>

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.460
It smells good!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.970
Are you still a fan of Darjeeling?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.850
If I can drink it,
I wouldn't mind if it was just water.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.890
I'm glad you look very well, Archaman.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.730
Though, it seems
you didn't proceed to Magecraft.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.310
For me right now,

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.730
this is all I can do
with my little knowledge and skills.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.200
"When someone is too humble,
they sound sarcastic," they say.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.120
I think they are right.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:27.870
Where are you working now?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:31.500
Well, I couldn't vibe with anywhere.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.580
That said, I'd like to ask you for a favor.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.920
If possible, I'd like you to hire me
at your place. What do you think?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.810
Now, you're only at a starting point,
Romani Archaman.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.190
The information resource recorded
in the history of humanity...

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:59.150
or a band of records called "Heroic Spirits"
are materialized using Magical Energy

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.070
and put to work as Servants.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:05.570
Furthermore, if a Heroic Spirit
is not able to materialize by itself,

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.370
we allow it to possess a human
to become a Servant.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.580
That is called a Pseudo-Servant,

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.200
but that experiment isn't even that.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.370
It's a fusion of a human
and a Heroic Spirit,

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.420
made into a weapon
with a physical body.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.210
It's a Demi-Servant Project.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.210
You've been doing such experiments
for ten years now?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.550
Yes.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.590
We have fostered countless units
for the project.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.560
She was the most perfect
among all the units.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:38.810
However, the Heroic Spirit who fused with her
refused to assist us and went silent.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.020
That girl merely put a burden on her body

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.650
and hasn't manifested
any powers as a Servant.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.150
You're wrong.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.030
We succeeded in activating the Relic.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.530
Using this as the catalyst,

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.910
we can perform more stable experiments
of the Heroic Spirit system.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.790
Servants are indispensable factors
for the preservation of humanity.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.750
Even if the Rayshift experiment
were to be a success,

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.670
it's utter nonsense
if we don't have any weapons on-site.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:09.220
But now, we can commence work
on a more reliable summoning system.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.640
All thanks to her noble sacrifice.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.350
But she is a designer baby.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.850
Her cells degrade much quicker
to begin with,

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.400
and there's a possibility that the degradation
has quickened from this experiment.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.690
On the other hand,
by fusing with a Heroic Spirit,

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.400
she'll maintain
her physical body at her peak.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.610
There will be no aging
due to cell degradation.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:32.620
Isn't that something to envy?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.370
She doesn't have to be able to fight.
All she needs is to stay alive.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.370
I'll have her accompany Team A
just as a catalyst for summons.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.380
I don't expect any more out of her,
and I'd be troubled if you did.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.880
I'll be her primary physician.
You're fine with that?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:54.260
One thing to confirm...
Is that out of sympathy?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.850
No, I will simply keep check
on her health as a doctor.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.850
She's in a difficult condition,

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.650
so anyone other than myself
can't make her last more than two years.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.400
Fine.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.460
Senpai?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.590
No, I got posted here
at Chaldea five years ago,

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.920
so you would be my Senpai.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.800
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.890
I'm Romani Archaman.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.680
From now on,
I'll be your primary physician.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.730
Just call me Roman.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.270
Let's see.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.570
"Doctor Roman."
Sounds cool, doesn't it?

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:50.860
Roman...

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.950
"A wishful observation
that tomorrow has many possibilities."

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.330
That's what that word meant, right?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.490
Oh?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.250
You're still only ten years old.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.370
Impressive as a Senpai should be!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.250
"Senpai" and "Kouhai" refer
to a relationship of teaching and learning.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:10.090
But Doctor, I haven't taught you anything.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.260
Sheba was responsible
for inputting all of my knowledge.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.050
So, the Senpai for knowledge
would be Sheba.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.510
Well,

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.600
I guess that's how things would be
with that train of thought.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.150
Yes. That's the definition
of "Senpai" for me.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.770
I see.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.860
My interpretation is slightly different.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.360
The way I think...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.990
is that perhaps for you,
if there's anyone you could call "Senpai,"

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:42.250
that would be someone
who is very naturally human.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.500
Very naturally human?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.960
They would feel joy, sadness
and anger very naturally.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:54.300
And they'd be able to live faithfully
even in the midst of others' emotions.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.760
Someone like them.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.510
Communication...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.430
So, that would be a Senpai
for a way of living?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.810
Right. Also, someone who can see
what is beyond all of that.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.190
Beyond that?

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:08.150
Yep.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:12.860
Someone who is a philanthropist,
friendly, compassionate...

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:17.530
And he'd act, even without reason,
not for his sake but for someone else's.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:22.290
I believe that's a virtue
that only humans possess.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.920
So, you mean someone
who's not egotistic but altruistic?

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.210
Wouldn't that be a disadvantage?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.550
It's losing out as an animal.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:34.590
You're right.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.470
Above all, humans are creatures
who think about their actions.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.060
And they must make
very complicated decisions.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:47.940
But that's all the more reason why someone with
the will to put himself at a loss is of great interest.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.860
I see.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:55.950
Well then, I will add that
in my conditions of being a Senpai.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.700
So, you are not a Senpai?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.910
Nope.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.580
I'm still nothing but a fledgling.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.500
Now, as part of becoming
your primary physician,

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.210
there's one thing I must tell you.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.010
It's about your life span.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.720
Since you are a designer baby,
your cells degrade quickly.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.890
Even if you were to properly
upkeep your health,

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.060
your life span is 18 years at most.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.730
First off, do you understand that?

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:35.360
Yes. All creatures have limited lives.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.360
I have no doubts concerning
how long I can stay active.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.120
I see.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.080
This will be more troublesome
than I thought.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:51.380
Do you mean maintaining my health?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.670
Yeah. Well, that's a given.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.760
But that all depends
on how much effort I put in.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.840
As long as I'm alive,
I will keep you in top form.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.050
The problem is...

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.180
No, it's nothing.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.560
So, again, I'm pleased to meet you...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:10.940
Mash.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:13.810
Utterly ridiculous!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.320
Now, now, calm down...

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.570
Summoned Heroic Spirit Number Three.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.110
No, Leonardo da Vinci.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.620
I am calm.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.330
I am merely appalled.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.460
Protecting the future of humanity?
With only this much equipment?

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.000
On top of that,
Demi-Servant experiments?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:36.050
Inefficient and inhumane.
Not one shred of beauty lies within!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.590
If you had summoned me much earlier,

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:42.090
I wouldn't have let mediocre men
perform such an act of folly.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.600
You're correct in feeling irritated.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.890
There's no way
that something like this is just.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.730
I plan on facing her
with the correct perception

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:54.520
that how we're doing this is a mistake.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.240
You're an idiot in a different sense.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.950
Hey, Romani...

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.450
That path is all too...

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:19.170
Do you know any Magecraft
that can reveal the sky, Professor Leff?

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.380
What's with the sudden question?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:28.390
Well, fine. The answer would be something
like "There is one, but it's meaningless."

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.270
Instead of making
the skies of Chaldea here sunny,

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.140
it would be far cheaper
to just head out to Antarctica.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.310
You can even see
a better sky out there, too.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.650
I see.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.440
Well, I guess that's how it is.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.320
But why are you asking
something like that?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.820
Are you, a doctor, getting homesick?

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.990
No way.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.080
Just something on my mind.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.450
Is it about Mash?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.500
Yeah.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.210
I see. That is quite intriguing.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.040
I was invited here to Chaldea as a Mage

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.710
to create Near-Future Observation Lens: Sheba.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.720
During that process, I've tutored Mash.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.720
It was only about Magecraft,

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.180
but I believe I've been with her
longer than you have.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:15.730
She's been raised to be as innocent and
good-natured as possible in both mind and body

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.980
so that she'll be able to assimilate
any Heroic Spirit in due time.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.030
Indeed, Mash's mental activity
is very stable.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.490
She shows no sway in her emotions
because her logic is perfect.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.870
However, there's nothing we can do
about the pain she feels physically.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.620
The periodic checkups cause her pain.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.250
Distress will turn into terror,
and in due time, it will become hatred.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:43.050
A heart that's been continually tortured
as such can't stay innocent.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.840
But she has...

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.800
...still stayed innocent, huh?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:52.430
She doesn't compare herself
to others, Romani.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:56.020
That's why she never envies
or hates anyone else.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:01.900
For her, every human
is a "Senpai of life," in a sense.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:05.780
She admires every person
who is existing to the utmost.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.280
No matter how much pain
or injustice she is put under,

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.580
Mash would only try to know
about the good parts of humans.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.830
She said she liked the vibe
when someone was smiling,

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.830
and that it made her happy
seeing them like that.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:24.000
Come to think of it, the same thing
can be said for all of us.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.090
It's simply ordinary.
It's simply ordinary, Romani.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.470
That said, isn't it intriguing?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:36.350
Because how she'll mature is something
nobody knows for certain.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.810
It may sound good to say "innocent,"

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.480
but that also means she's still very young.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.440
Even after experiencing
the ugliness of humanity

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.780
and the dark side of human history,

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.990
will she still say humanity is admirable?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.700
That's the one small bit of regret I feel.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.000
WHAT DO YOU DESIRE?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.960
THE HOLY GRAIL WAR IS OVER.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.760
WE WERE VICTORIOUS.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.260
...WHAT DO YOU DESIRE?

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.510
THE COMPLETION OF CHALDEAS.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.760
I DON'T CARE ABOUT THE THIRD MAGIC.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.270
I, WE THE ANIMUSPHERES
GOVERNING ASTROMANCY,

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.770
MUST REACH THE ROOT
WITH AN APPROACH UNIQUE TO US.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.520
AS FOR YOU...

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.280
<i>What do you desire?</i>

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.660
Oh, it's you.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.740
You're five minutes late.
It's not like you.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.120
"Stop Chaldeas," huh?

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:42.250
Your request is rather difficult.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.130
The preservation of humanity,
or my own life.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.420
Which will I prioritize?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.760
That goes without saying.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.890
The flame of Chaldeas?

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.770
<i>That day came all too soon.</i>

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:04.480
<i>"The history of humanity
will cease to exist as of 2016."</i>

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:09.530
<i>After finding out the cause of such
an abnormal disappearance of the future,</i>

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.110
<i>Chaldeas investigated all information
for the past 2000 years.</i>

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:13.740
<i>As a result,</i>

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.120
<i>it found Spatial Singularity F...</i>

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.040
<i>In 2004 AD,
in a certain local city in Japan,</i>

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:23.330
<i>it located a realm that wasn't observable,</i>

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.880
<i>a foreign substance
that didn't exist in history up to 2015.</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.880
<i>Chaldea assumed that this was
the cause of the extinction of humanity,</i>

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>and proposed the Rayshift experiment
to United Nations,</i>

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.260
<i>at which point the project passed.</i>

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.640
<i>Rayshift is converting
humans to spiritrons</i>

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.520
<i>and then transporting them to the past
in order to intervene in matters.</i>

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.640
<i>To be blunt, it's time travel to the past.</i>

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:48.150
<i>And Mash was selected to be in Team A,
in charge of the first mission.</i>

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.030
In any case,

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.610
the director really hates me.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.870
The air becomes slack
if I'm on-site, she says.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.830
<i>Well, nothing I can do about that.</i>

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.870
<i>I may not look it,
but I'm going full throttle.</i>

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.960
Excuse me.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.800
It's occupied— Wait!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.050
Who are you?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:21.060
<i>Back then, I had no doubts.</i>

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.230
<i>To the pain they gave me.</i>

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.020
<i>To the limited time I had.</i>

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.980
<i>To my own way of existence.</i>

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:32.530
There never has been a doctor
who came into my room.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.150
Oh, really?

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:38.740
Chaldea really is advanced if you can convey
your emotions even through glass.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.370
I'm still but a fledgling,

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.120
so I can't have a proper conversation
unless I speak directly like this.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:50.420
So, don't hesitate to tell me
what you think and what you feel.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.760
This way, I can get to know you better,

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.260
and more than anything else,
you may feel warmer.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.640
Summon Case Number Two...

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.010
No, no longer as of today.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:06.350
Hello and nice to meet you,
"Mash Kyrielight."

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:13.820
H-Hello and nice to meet you,

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.530
Doctor Romani.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:22.280
<i>If you are to say a reaction like this
is what you'd expect from a human,</i>

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.330
<i>maybe at this moment,</i>

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.410
<i>I made a reaction like that of a human
for the very first time.</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.790
Good morning, Mash.
How are you feeling today?

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:38.760
<i>Since then, Doctor spent a lot of time
in conversations with me.</i>

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:39.970
<i>For me,</i>

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:45.060
<i>anything and everything
was a completely new experience.</i>

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.690
<i>We talked about what I felt,
what I thought,</i>

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.690
<i>what I liked, what was dear to me,</i>

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.310
<i>what I felt was warm.</i>

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.570
<i>He sometimes told me amusing tales
of what happened within the facility.</i>

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:59.450
<i>And I sometimes had to listen
to him complain.</i>

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:05.700
<i>Gradually, I became drawn
to the temperature of the outside world.</i>

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.420
Good morning, Mash.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.550
I have good news today.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.720
Your vitals have been very good recently.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.010
Your brain waves are stable,

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.600
so if this condition continues,
you'll no longer need to stay in the clean room.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:30.730
When that happens, you'll publicly
become a researcher in Chaldea.

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.150
Thank you so much.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:36.360
I know! I'll celebrate
when that time comes!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.530
Do you want anything?

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.620
Well, a book? A toy? Sweets?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.240
Don't you have anything you want?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.620
I'll get you anything if I can!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:58.420
I'd like to go outside.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.390
<i>I want to go outside
and look up at the clear sky.</i>

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:08.560
<i>That was the one and only thing
I desired that I could think of.</i>

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:13.810
<i>Unfortunately, Chaldea is located in a wintery
mountain 6000 meters above sea level.</i>

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.690
<i>All you can see outside is a blizzard.</i>

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.530
<i>But very rarely, the skies will clear up,</i>

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.070
<i>and you'll be able to see
a beautiful starry sky.</i>

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:27.330
<i>I'm sure that someday,
you'll be able to see it, as well.</i>

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.330
Fou...

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:41.340
<i>This is a strange creature
that recently started snuggling up to me.</i>

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.220
Fou, have you ever seen a starry sky?

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:53.350
The skies aren't clear again today.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:57.900
Fou?

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.190
Wait!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.730
Please wait!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.210
<i>The first thing I wished for was the sky.</i>

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.880
<i>Our King has pitied humans</i>

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:27.140
<i>and declared he would release them
from the premise of death.</i>

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.100
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.890
<i>Isn't that right, Mash?</i>

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:36.150
<i>Do humans truly have
that much value within them?</i>

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:40.480
<i>What will you fall in love with?</i>

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.360
<i>What will you come to detest?</i>

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.360
<i>What do you feel is precious?</i>

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.360
<i>And what will you believe to be evil?</i>

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.370
<i>Those are all for you to decide.</i>

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.580
<i>We learn about many things</i>

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.710
<i>and see many different scenery.</i>

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:00.210
<i>That's how your life becomes substantial.</i>

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:01.710
<i>See here.</i>

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:04.470
<i>It's not that you create the world.</i>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.630
<i>The world creates you.</i>

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.470
<i>An eternal empire continues to exist.</i>

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.470
<i>Even if the emperor changes.
Even if the country changes.</i>

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.480
<i>Even if its name changes.</i>

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:17.520
<i>That is the law of human prosperity.</i>

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.480
<i>That is the family tree of lives
called "humans."</i>

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>Wrongdoers do good deeds at times,</i>

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:25.280
<i>and good men do evil deeds at times.</i>

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:27.280
<i>That's how humans are.</i>

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:29.280
<i>That's how we are!</i>

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:33.160
<i>That's why there's hope in everyone!</i>

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>Why do you fight?</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.460
<i>Knowing that it is a life
that will end at some point.</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:41.040
<i>Knowing that the life
has been already spent.</i>

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:44.050
<i>Why do you cling on,
trying to continue living?</i>

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>Even though you realize
that in your future,</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:49.970
<i>there is not one shred of salvation.</i>

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:51.720
<i>Ms. Mash...</i>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.470
<i>A dream and a desire are different things.</i>

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:56.850
<i>Take an endless sharp look at reality,</i>

00:22:56.850 --> 00:22:58.100
<i>understand its numbers.</i>

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:02.650
<i>Fighting thoroughly to the very end
is how the path for the wisher is paved.</i>

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:08.450
<i>You should live life
for your own sake from now on.</i>

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.370
<i>There's no logic behind my actions.</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>I do things how I want to do them.</i>

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:21.130
<i>No, I hold my head high
and believe in what I feel must be done.</i>

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:23.880
<i>You are the same as me.</i>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:26.380
<i>I am sure of it.</i>

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.590
<i>The first thing I wished for was the sky.</i>

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.010
<i>However,</i>

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:35.140
<i>that was merely a dream where I simply
waited at the windowsill during a blizzard.</i>

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.270
<i>But things are different now.</i>

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.730
<i>I saw many scenes and met various people</i>

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:45.770
<i>and felt the vastness of the world
and the warmth of people.</i>

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:54.200
<i>That's right! Indeed, I feel it!</i>

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:57.790
<i>I have been pulled into a shape.</i>

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:00.370
<i>My true desire...</i>

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:04.920
<i>The shape of my heart
was made during this journey.</i>

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:08.920
<i>I'll surely be born during this journey.</i>

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:15.100
<i>And then, it will be my turn
to return its answer back to the world!</i>

00:24:32.110 --> 00:24:35.030
Would it be okay if you could...

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:36.740
hold my hand?

00:24:47.960 --> 00:24:50.090
Thank you very much,

00:24:51.090 --> 00:24:52.420
Senpai.

00:26:44.370 --> 00:26:48.040
<i>Today, we'll be executing our Rayshift
to the Seventh Singularity.</i>

00:26:50.170 --> 00:26:51.090
<i>I...</i>

00:26:52.290 --> 00:26:54.340
<i>will be embarking on another journey!</i>
